silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_06_cross_paper_bridges_sections_05_bridge_to_14_yoneda_concrete_anchors#bridgeto14anchor silm:hasLongDescription "The BridgeTo14Anchor is concretely, the central object of this section instantiated in the household story (Mittens, Pumpkin, Dr. Patel, 77 Maple Street, or the chart/chip/registry witnesses). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'central object of section', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
